#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md:3
msgid "`conf.py`"
msgstr "`conf.py`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standard"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Bedeutung"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`deciwa_mode`"
msgstr "`deciwa_mode`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`\"auto\"`"
msgstr "`\"auto\"`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid ""
"`auto`: use `deciwa serve` when it answers, otherwise review offline · "
"`offline`: never ask for a server (static sites, demos) · `server`: never"
" go offline"
msgstr ""
"`auto`: `deciwa serve` nutzen, wenn es antwortet, sonst offline reviewen "
"· `offline`: nie nach einem Server fragen (statische Seiten, Demos) · "
"`server`: nie offline gehen"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`deciwa_offline_annotations`"
msgstr "`deciwa_offline_annotations`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`True`"
msgstr "`True`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid ""
"ship the feedback from `.deciwa/` with the build, so offline readers see "
"it; set `False` for public builds"
msgstr ""
"das Feedback aus `.deciwa/` mit dem Build ausliefern, damit es auch "
"offline sichtbar ist; für öffentliche Builds auf `False` setzen"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`deciwa_root`"
msgstr "`deciwa_root`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "the folder that holds `.deciwa/` above `conf.py`"
msgstr "der Ordner über `conf.py`, der `.deciwa/` enthält"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "where `.deciwa/` lives, if it is not above the docs"
msgstr "wo `.deciwa/` liegt, falls es nicht über den Docs liegt"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md:11
msgid ""
"Options can also be given on the command line, e.g. `sphinx-build -D "
"deciwa_mode=offline …`."
msgstr ""
"Optionen lassen sich auch auf der Kommandozeile setzen, z. B. `sphinx-"
"build -D deciwa_mode=offline …`."

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md:14
msgid "`.deciwa/config.toml`"
msgstr "`.deciwa/config.toml`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md:28
msgid ""
"`required` takes element kinds (`need`, `heading`, `paragraph`, `item`, "
"`row`, `code`, `note`, `figure`), `all`, or selector patterns such as "
"`sphinx-needs:PROP_*` – see [what must be approved](../../product/review-"
"rules.md). The kinds can also be switched in the panel; patterns and "
"paths are set here."
msgstr ""
"`required` nimmt Elementarten (`need`, `heading`, `paragraph`, `item`, "
"`row`, `code`, `note`, `figure`), `all` oder Selektor-Muster wie `sphinx-"
"needs:PROP_*` – siehe [was freigegeben werden muss](../../product/review-"
"rules.md). Die Arten lassen sich auch im Panel schalten; Muster und Pfade"
" stehen hier."

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md:34
msgid "Elements the extension finds"
msgstr "Elemente, die die Erweiterung findet"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "Art"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "In the page"
msgstr "In der Seite"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`need`"
msgstr "`need`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "every Sphinx-Needs object, by its id"
msgstr "jedes Sphinx-Needs-Objekt, über seine ID"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`heading`"
msgstr "`heading`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "a section, picked through its heading"
msgstr "ein Abschnitt, ausgewählt über seine Überschrift"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`paragraph`, `item`, `row`, `code`, `note`"
msgstr "`paragraph`, `item`, `row`, `code`, `note`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "paragraphs, list items, table rows, code blocks, admonitions"
msgstr "Absätze, Listenpunkte, Tabellenzeilen, Codeblöcke, Hinweisboxen"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "`figure`"
msgstr "`figure`"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md
msgid "images, figures and inline HTML pictures such as SVG diagrams"
msgstr "Grafiken, Abbildungen und eingebettete HTML-Bilder wie SVG-Diagramme"

#: ../../integrations/sphinx/configuration.md:43
msgid ""
"Generated content (tables of needs, the table of contents) is not "
"reviewable; review its source instead."
msgstr ""
"Erzeugte Inhalte (Need-Tabellen, das Inhaltsverzeichnis) lassen sich "
"nicht reviewen; reviewe stattdessen ihre Quelle."

